# Template for scripts/pii-denylist.txt (which is gitignored and holds the
# real private strings). Copy this file to scripts/pii-denylist.txt and add
# one literal per line: real first/last names, personal mail domains, home
# directory paths, internal IP addresses, referral tokens, session tokens,
# hostnames, chat handles. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# DO NOT put real values in this .example file. It is committed.
# Matching is case-insensitive fixed-string, and also covers base64,
# percent-encoded, JSON-escaped, and split-digit forms of each value.
